终端: 第三次治疗后，埃德温的回应停止。档案以“疗程达到上限”结束，不直接展示死亡。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030312e7265616374696f6e_3 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_CLOSE_046 #kind:narration
===

title: Core_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030322e7265616374696f6e
---
埃德温: 我想睡一觉。但我没有说，我想把他们忘了。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030322e7265616374696f6e_0 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_004
埃德温: 你选择了安静。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030322e7265616374696f6e_1 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_005
埃德温: 别再叫我病人。病人还能被治疗。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030322e7265616374696f6e_2 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_014
终端: 净化程序完成。埃德温从队列中消失，记录没有交代他之后的命运。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030322e7265616374696f6e_3 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_CLOSE_047 #kind:narration
===

title: Core_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030352e7265616374696f6e
---
埃德温: 你听完了。谢谢你没有替我把最后一句说掉。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030352e7265616374696f6e_0 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_006
埃德温: 我知道门外还有什么。我还是想自己走出去。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030352e7265616374696f6e_1 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_007
埃德温: 打开门。让我保留后果。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030352e7265616374696f6e_2 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_ACTION_008
终端: 埃德温走向门外。释放不证明他已经康复，只代表他保留了自己的感受与选择。 #line:mg_626174746c656669656c642d646f63746f725f5f5030345f44335f52315f504c415945525f414354494f4e5f3030352e7265616374696f6e_3 #source:battlefield-doctor__P04_D3_R1_CLOSE_048 #kind:narration
===

